    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d502">

                <pb facs="0621" n="541" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg541"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hill to Mr. Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-02-13"><hi rendition="#italic">February 13,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hill states that the <hi rendition="#italic">Scorpion’s</hi> visit to the
                    Orinoco to obtain information was in accordance with numerous precedents and
                    without offensive intention.</p>
                <p>The vessel was ordered to La Guaira, touching at Cumana, Carupano, and
                    Barcelona.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
